    have eV:(∑ i∈s\U,v i)=(∑ i∈s,v i)-(∑ i∈U,v i):=by omega
    have eZ:(∑ i∈s\U,z i)=(∑ i∈s,z i)-(∑ i∈U,z i):=by omega
